Enterprise applications
Benefits:
Improved uptime
Better performance
Reduced server overload
Automatic failover

The module demonstrated how Load Balancer supports resilient cloud architectures.

Step 6: Understanding Azure Load Balancer Limitations

The training explained what Azure Load Balancer does not provide.

Azure Load Balancer does not:

Perform SSL termination
Provide Web Application Firewall (WAF)
Inspect application content
Route based on URLs
Layer 4 only:
TCP
UDP
For Layer 7 capabilities use:
Azure Application Gateway
Azure Front Door

The module emphasized understanding the difference between Layer 4 and Layer 7 load balancing.

